mpressive... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If I heard that, I'd definitely want to buy a ticket to see them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Into_stone","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"branch","value":"2","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"2","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It might be your imagination, but you think you just saw a vein throbbing on the production assistant's temple."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I want to go the wholesome and sentimental route and focus on the hardships that Franchouchou has experienced, the setbacks that they have overcome along the way..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's hear you rehearse it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Franchouchou..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Sad","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You feel a lump in your throat just saying this word."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In the beginning, we were just an unknown group. People wouldn't even spare us a glance even when we were busking for free in the streets. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We often had to go hungry, we couldn't sleep, and we dared not complain even when we were treated badly at performances... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But despite all the scorn, all the derision, we never gave up our dream! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Our dream is to bring Saga—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The production assistant interrupts you expressionlessly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What do you think this is? Oliver Twist? Are you even talking about Franchouchou?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"},{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't this the unspoken rule in the entertainment industry? Reasonable exaggeration plus a little bit of artistic embellishment?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Into_stone","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It might be your imagination, but you think you just saw a vein throbbing on the production assistant's temple."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I want to go the friendly and approachable route and make Franchouchou seem more down-to-earth. I want Franchouchou to leave a good impression on the audience, so that they will come and support us at the concert."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's hear you rehearse it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Franchouchou."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_1","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You put on a benevolent smile and start introducing the group in a friendly and jocular tone."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All seven members were selected from girls with ordinary backgrounds. They are positively radiant on stage, but they are no different from the ordinary girls around you in daily life. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They are very skilled singers and dancers, but they are also flawed like ordinary people. They are clumsy; they sometimes quite literally lose their heads. They can also be very childish and have a habit of gnawing on others' heads... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But the moment they put on their idol outfits and step on stage, they—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The production assistant interrupts you expressionlessly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You think you're very funny, don't you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yep!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You nod with confidence."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I believe such an introduction will make the audience find Franchouchou very approachable. Coming to our concert will feel as natural as coming home to them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Into_stone","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Production Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[